{
  "description": "HTTP, SAQ and database health for the api and worker processes.",
  "editable": true,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "HTTP",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Routes are TEMPLATES -- '/record/{file_id}', never a real file uuid -- and anything matching no route reports the literal '__unmatched__'. That is what keeps a 404 scan from minting one series per probed path. Measured baselines (phaze-zaf2l section 4): /pipeline/stats 534.0 ms fired every 5 s by every open admin tab, /pipeline/tracklist-drain-status 1,378.6 ms.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(10, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(phaze_http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, http_route)))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Request duration p95, by route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (http_status_class) (rate(phaze_http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{http_status_class}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Requests / s by status class",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Duty cycle, not latency -- the read that exposes a cheap-looking endpoint on a fast timer. phaze-zaf2l measured /pipeline/stats at a 10.68% continuous duty cycle: 384.5 s of handler time per wall hour for a browser tab left open.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (http_route) (rate(phaze_http_server_request_duration_seconds_sum{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Handler seconds per wall second, by route",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(phaze_http_server_active_requests{job=~\"$job\"})",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "in flight",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Requests in flight",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "id": 6,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "SAQ",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "phaze-zaf2l measured production depth holding at 9 across 28 samples and filed NO bead against SAQ: a local burst drained 5,000 jobs at 318.3/s against a production load of 0.0939 jobs/s, i.e. 0.03% of capacity. Labelled by STAGE, not by queue -- the sampler groups by SAQ function name, and calling that a queue would be mislabelled data. POLL-DRIVEN: sampled by the admin UI's own /pipeline/stats read, so it goes stale when no tab is open.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (stage, status) (phaze_pipeline_stage_inflight{job=~\"$job\"})",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}} / {{status}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "SAQ rows queued and active, by pipeline stage",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Labelled `saq_function`, not `job`: `job` is reserved by Prometheus for the target derived from service.name, and a metric that collides with it is dropped ENTIRELY by the collector.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(10, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(phaze_saq_job_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, saq_function)))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{saq_function}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Job duration p95, by function",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "unit": "/min"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(phaze_saq_jobs_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Job outcomes / min",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Scheduling-ledger transitions: a stage SCHEDULED for a file, and that row RESOLVED. The ledger is the durable record recovery reads.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "/min"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28
      },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (stage, transition) (rate(phaze_pipeline_stage_transitions_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}} {{transition}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Pipeline stage transitions / min",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "id": 11,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Database",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Only the leading keyword is ever a label. The statement TEXT is unbounded AND carries operator data -- a WHERE clause over this archive is a local identifier that would be stored forever.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37
      },
      "id": 12,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(phaze_db_statement_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, db_operation))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{db_operation}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Statement duration p95, by operation",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Divided by request rate this is per-request fan-out -- the cost phaze-zaf2l had to measure with pg_stat_user_tables deltas against a duration-matched idle control.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 37
      },
      "id": 13,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (db_operation) (rate(phaze_db_statements_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{db_operation}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Statements / s by operation",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "tags": [
    "phaze",
    "service"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
